ctual entity, Deus grants Yukiteru a \\\"Random Diary,\\\" which shows highly descriptive entries based on the future and forces him into a bloody battle royale with 11 other holders of similarly powerful future diaries.\\n\\nWith the last person standing designated as the new god of time and space, Yukiteru must find and kill the other 11 in order to survive. He reluctantly teams up with his obsessive stalker Yuno Gasai (who also possesses such a diary), and she takes it upon herself to ensure his safety. But there's more to the girl than meets the eye, as she might have other plans for her unrequited love...4\\n\\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"cOmW9c43QkA\",\"name\":\"Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Yuno Gasai\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/31706/image/tiny-eee8b577f5e7a565ad852bc306302415.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Tomosa Murata\"},{\"name\":\"Reisuke's Father\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":null,\"voiceActor\":\"Kiyohiro Yamaguchi\"},{\"name\":\"Aru Akise\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/34832/image/tiny-e02258718529ed55341074c648121738.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Akira Ishida\"},{\"name\":\"Kurou Amano\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/34834/image/tiny-e955add623b866de0972a76ce55b11de.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Takehito Koyasu\"},{\"name\":\"Rea Amano\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/34833/image/tiny-5f2d0bad6f6ac76a1f5e66bcaa9737c7.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Kaoru Mizuhara\"},{\"name\":\"John Bacchus\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/34835/image/tiny-a7d963f11a23ee614581e498ed6a10c5.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Takaya Hashi\"},{\"name\":\"Deus Ex Machina\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/31707/image/tiny-e47165db3179583bcd853c222f47bf94.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Norio Wakamoto\"},{\"name\":\"Funatsu\",\"rol